      "expectedOutcome": "Solid theoretical and practical grasp of distributed caching concepts.",
      "codeSnippet": "// Cache-Aside Workflow:\n//\n// Client Request -> [Check Cache (Redis)]\n//                         │\n//            ┌────────────┴────────────┐\n//         Hit (Data exists)        Miss (Not in cache)\n//            │                         │\n//            ↓                         ↓\n//     Return cached data      Query Primary Database (MongoDB)\n//                                      │\n//                                      ↓\n//                             Save to Cache (with TTL)\n//                                      │\n//                                      ↓\n//                             Return data to client"
